Basic Regular Expression - BRE   - Single pattern
Extened Regular Expression - ERE - More than one pattern 

BRE
===
^		-> ^pattern  - matches line starts with pattern 
$		->  pattern$ - matches line ends with pattern 
^pattern$	-> ^pattern$ - pattern only 
.		-> match any single char, except \n
.*		-> List of all

[]   ------------->[]<-- Single Character => [Aav]run ->Arun arun vrun //OK
				[Aa][Rr]un
				-----------
				 ARun  Arun aRun arun //OK
[a-z] - match any lowercase
[A-Z] - match any uppercase
[a-zA-Z] - match any alpha
[0-9] - match any digits  (or) \d 

[a-zA-Z0-9] (or) \w 

^[]  --------->  ^[A-Z].*[a-z]$
[]$  -------->[a-z]$ <-- line end with any single lowercase chars

[^] --->NOT  => [^abc] ==> NOT match a NOT match b  NOT match c

^[a-z] 						 [^a-z] 
-----//line starts with any lowercase Vs    ======== Not matching any lower case

[^a-zA-Z0-9]
==============//Not matching any alpha numeric 

^$ -->Empty line
---------------------
ERE
====
|  ()  +   {}

| ->like logical OR - any one pattern is matched -OK

re.search("sales|prod","101,leo,sales,pune") ->OK

re.search("sales|prod","102,anu,prod,pune") ->OK

re.search("sales|prod","103,bibu,admin,hyd") ->None 
			--------------------

() -> like logical AND -> both pattern should match in same order
(pattern1)(pattern2)

re.search("(sales).(pune)","asdfsfdsf sales<CHAR>pune asdffs") ->OK
				      ===============


re.search("(sales).(pune)","asdfsfdsf pune<CHAR>sales asdffs") ->None
				      ===============

<pattern>+ -> 1 or more times
-----------
ab+c => abc abbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbc //OK

re.search("^\s+",input_string) 
	  -----
	    |->line starts with 1 or more space 

{} <== IRE

<pattern>{n}  - times

ab{3}c
-----------> abbbc

^[A-Z][A-Z][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][a-z][a-z][a-z]$ <== BRE

^[A-Z]{2}[0-9]{5}[a-z]{3}$ <== ERE


<pattern>{n}  - times
<pattern>{n,}  - minimum n times , maximum nolimit
ab{3,}c => abbbc abbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbc//OK

ab+c ---same as---> ab{1,}c
--------------------------------

<pattern>{n,m}  - minimum n times , maximum m times

ab{3,5}c ==> abbbc abbbbc abbbbbc //OK

 



